# Restoration smoke: fresh uncleared save; ordinary controls, no power or collision cheats.
# Only the initial map transfer is poked; subsequent movement and death use guest controls.
# This is an opening/death/re-entry smoke, not an end-to-end clear.
# Fresh-session input route shared by reference and native hosts.
# No imported savestates. All waits are host-frame calls.
wait 600
press start 2
wait 180
press start 2
wait 900
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180

# Practice map transfer: map 6, X=0x128, Y=0x1e8.
poke 1f11 0606
poke 1f17 2801e8012801e801
poke 1f1f 12001e0012001e00
poke 0100 0b
wait 240


dump map
press y 2
until 0100 == 12 300
dump loaded
until 0100 == 13 300
dump initialized
until 0100 == 14 100
wait 90
dump standing
press right+y 120
dump run
press right+y+b 90
dump jump
press right+y 120
dump falling
wait 300
dump death_return
press y 2
until 0100 == 14 360
wait 90
dump reentry
quit
